  "steps": [
    "Put the chickpeas in a bowl and roughly mash them with a fork, leaving some whole for texture.",
    "Add the avocado, red onion, celery, lemon juice, mustard, olive oil, salt and black pepper. Mix until the filling is creamy and well combined.",
    "Toast the bread lightly if you like.",
    "Layer lettuce and tomato on two slices of bread, then spoon over the smashed chickpea mixture.",
    "Top with the remaining bread slices, press gently, and serve right away."
